                  <img src="/assets/influences/julie-zhuo.jpg" alt="Julie Zhuo" width="200" height="200" loading="lazy">
                </a>
                <a class="avatar-item" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jony_Ive" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Jony Ive">
